  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/12/IMG_3069.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">El alumnado que ha cumplido en 2015 50 a&ntilde;os del antiguo colegio Monteblanco de Onda se ha reunido para celebrarlo en una comida de hermandad, en la que se han intercambiado recuerdos y experiencias.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/50anysalumnatcolemonteblanco/img_3043.jpg\" alt=\"img_3043\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/50anysalumnatcolemonteblanco/img_3044.jpg\" alt=\"img_3044\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/50anysalumnatcolemonteblanco/img_3045.jpg\" alt=\"img_3045\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/50anysalumnatcolemonteblanco/img_3046.jpg\" alt=\"img_3046\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/50anysalumnatcolemonteblanco/img_3048.jpg\" alt=\"img_3048\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/50anysalumnatcolemonteblanco/img_3049.jpg\" alt=\"img_3049\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/50anysalumnatcolemonteblanco/img_3051.jpg\" alt=\"img_3051\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/50anysalumnatcolemonteblanco/img_3053.jpg\" alt=\"img_3053\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/50anysalumnatcolemonteblanco/img_3054.jpg\" alt=\"img_3054\" style=\"max-width:100%;height